   <title>NASA&#039;s Voyager 1 reaches a light-day away from Earth</title>
   <link>https://www.dw.com/en/nasa-s-voyager-1-reaches-a-light-day-away-from-earth/a-79961817?maca=en-rss_en_science-22531-xml-mrss</link>
   <description>When just saying &#039;hello&#039; takes a two-day round trip, you&#039;re a light-day, or 26 billion kilometers, from Earth. Only one human-made object has ever traveled that far — and its journey into interstellar space continues.</description>
