   <title>Intelligent women get less help at work, study finds</title>
   <link>https://www.dw.com/en/intelligent-women-get-less-help-at-work-study-finds/a-79910881?maca=en-rss_en_science-22531-xml-mrss</link>
   <description>Women who scored high on intelligence tests were seen as more hostile by their teammates and got less help, a new study finds. High-scoring men faced no such penalty. Research explains why.</description>
